  "idea": "Calibre: the ultimate free eBook manager and format converter",
  "text": "The gold standard document converter that has remained free for over fifteen years. Commercial software charges monthly fees just to convert simple file types or adjust eBook layouts. Cloud uploaders paywall essential batch exports and expose sensitive documents to third-party web servers. Calibre gives you total offline control, letting you batch convert files, edit stylesheets, and clean metadata locally. Own your digital library without recurring software subscriptions.",
